pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
elements:
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 36, 300, 20]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: HIGHLIGHTS · PYTHON 篇
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 60, 760, 44]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 第 3-4 课：猜数字 + 单词消消乐
  - elementId: title-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 112, 832, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: l3-badge
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 138, 100, 26]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$accent"
      bold: true
      fontFamily: 微软雅黑
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 第 3 课
  - elementId: l3-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 168, 384, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 19
      color: "$text"
      bold: true
      fontFamily: 微软雅黑
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 猜数字游戏
  - elementId: l3-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 206, 384, 140]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>· while 循环：猜不对就一直猜</p>
        <p>· random 随机数与"大了 / 小了"判断</p>
        <p>· 练习：让 AI 解释每一行代码</p>
  - elementId: l3-out
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 352, 384, 26]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$cyan"
      bold: true
      fontFamily: 微软雅黑
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: ▶ 产出：带计次功能的猜数字游戏
  - elementId: divider-v
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [478, 138, 1, 310]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: l4-badge
    elementType: text
    bounds: [516, 138, 100, 26]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$accent"
      bold: true
      fontFamily: 微软雅黑
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 第 4 课
  - elementId: l4-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [516, 168, 384, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 19
      color: "$text"
      bold: true
      fontFamily: 微软雅黑
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 单词消消乐（Vibe Coding 初体验）
  - elementId: l4-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [516, 206, 380, 140]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>· 第一次用中文描述完整的游戏需求</p>
        <p>· 看 AI 一口气生成整个小游戏</p>
        <p>· 练习迭代：换单词表、加倒计时</p>
  - elementId: l4-out
    elementType: text
    bounds: [516, 352, 380, 26]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$cyan"
      bold: true
      fontFamily: 微软雅黑
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: ▶ 产出：英语单词消消乐小游戏
  - elementId: bottom-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 404, 832, 56]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [10000]
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$panel"}
  - elementId: bottom-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [88, 404, 784, 56]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$muted"
      fontFamily: 微软雅黑
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p>关键转折：第 4 课是学生第一次"只说想法、不写代码"就得到作品 —— Vibe Coding 的种子在这里种下。</p>
  - elementId: pagenum
    elementType: text
    bounds: [860, 500, 64, 20]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      align: [right, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 08 / 15
